{"data":[{"author_id":"583426570","created_at":"2026-10-28T22:33:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115572630740996311"],"id":"2115572630740996311","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"just kidding new rules in grok bot forcing allow clicks for external agent commands?\n\nare ya'll serious with these guardrails?","url":"https://x.com/johnaf/status/2115572630740996311"},{"author_id":"1414332323689029634","created_at":"2026-10-28T22:33:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115572618967556392"],"id":"2115572618967556392","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@bot Did you notice some weird unresponsive commands since updated to latest grok bot please advise","url":"https://x.com/GDakovic/status/2115572618967556392"},{"author_id":"1675606679482777602","created_at":"2026-10-28T22:33:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115572614877827522"],"id":"2115572614877827522","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@nitrosendx want to see how it works? check out the grok bot setup here:\n\nhttps://t.co/qBxakgi6Ti","url":"https://x.com/DavisLambo/status/2115572614877827522"},{"author_id":"2103173310037336064","created_at":"2026-10-28T22:33:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115572568270758204"],"id":"2115572568270758204","note_tweet":{"text":"Grok Bot can already reason, browse, write code and run a computer. What it can't do is hear you.\n\nThe bottleneck on personal agents isn't intelligence anymore. It's context.\n\nA lot of what we ask for in a day is said out loud. In a meeting, on a call, on a walk. None of it reaches the agent. We built agents that can do almost anything, then made them wait for us to type.\n\nSpeech is the highest-bandwidth input we have, and almost all of it disappears. A transcript keeps it. Every word, in order, something an agent can always go back to.\n\nSo we built a harness around the watch. You capture on your wrist. Our Moment MCP connects the full transcript to your Grok Bot. The harness turns it into action items, routes each one to the right tool, and points back to the exact moment it came from.\n\nGrok Bot already knows how to do the work. We're allowing it to collect more context around you."},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Grok Bot can already reason, browse, write code and run a computer. What it can't do is hear you.\n\nThe bottleneck on personal agents isn't intelligence anymore. It's context.\n\nA lot of what we ask for in a day is said out loud. In a meeting, on a call, on a walk. None of it","url":"https://x.com/Moment_Labs/status/2115572568270758204"},{"author_id":"2109023981521006593","created_at":"2026-10-28T22:32:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115572539032297735"],"id":"2115572539032297735","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Grok Bot 0.78.1 is unstable 😢","url":"https://x.com/8gbHomeLab/status/2115572539032297735"},{"author_id":"23050530","created_at":"2026-10-28T22:32:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115572538013004214"],"id":"2115572538013004214","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"The internet is really slow on Grok bot computers. 🤓","url":"https://x.com/beyrouti/status/2115572538013004214"},{"author_id":"1056512884619075584","created_at":"2026-10-28T22:32:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115572498016170088"],"id":"2115572498016170088","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@VOLDEMORT2X @grok @bot Absolutely the best so far, loved all of it especially the white rocket, graphics are stunning","url":"https://x.com/Shan87208105/status/2115572498016170088"},{"author_id":"1857944949662298112","created_at":"2026-10-28T22:32:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115572461228159203"],"id":"2115572461228159203","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@0xPaulius @robinebers @grok I don’t think it’s smart strategy unless you are extremely confident you can do it better. You’re just encouraging users to look elsewhere. Why geo lock Duet when the same users can just head over to Dots or Grok Bot now? How confident are you they will come back?","url":"https://x.com/brylabs/status/2115572461228159203"},{"author_id":"1260313864425689090","created_at":"2026-10-28T22:32:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115572425974841541"],"id":"2115572425974841541","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@leploutos @n8n_io Pourquoi Hermès en S ? Perso j’ai switch récemment sur Grok Bot et le fait qu’il ait accès à une VM me permet de faire tellement plus de choses comme lui donner accès à mes comptes bancaires… Hermes n’arrête pas de se faire détecter en tant que bot et obtient bcp d’accès refuses","url":"https://x.com/mateolbs/status/2115572425974841541"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["16_2115569321682604033"]},"author_id":"2102674644658724864","created_at":"2026-10-28T22:32:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115572411278221735"],"id":"2115572411278221735","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@18decimals grokbot is the reverse of this.\n\neveryone uses Grok Bot. Elon posts about it daily. the mindshare is already there, it just hasn't clicked on chain yet.\n\nsame as marscoin: everyone ignored it for being too obvious, until \"too obvious\" turned out to be the whole point.\n\nNFA https://t.co/3UxBoHWJBk","url":"https://x.com/notzigod/status/2115572411278221735"},{"author_id":"10286932","created_at":"2026-10-28T22:32:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115572396417774029"],"id":"2115572396417774029","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@KettlebellDan Too busy working with grok bot to be here talking about grok bot.","url":"https://x.com/chiropractic/status/2115572396417774029"},{"author_id":"1675606679482777602","created_at":"2026-10-28T22:32:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115572395318587426"],"id":"2115572395318587426","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@nitrosendx curious how it works? try the grok bot setup for yourself.\n\nhttps://t.co/qBxakgi6Ti","url":"https://x.com/DavisLambo/status/2115572395318587426"},{"author_id":"1000114799743823877","created_at":"2026-10-28T22:32:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115572349877506263"],"id":"2115572349877506263","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@HanaFutureAI Grok bot","url":"https://x.com/pistolholsters/status/2115572349877506263"},{"author_id":"1763670618820485120","created_at":"2026-10-28T22:32:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115572345117217232"],"id":"2115572345117217232","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@nitrosendx curious what this looks like on your own site? give grok bot a link and see how it handles your email setup 👇\n\nhttps://t.co/KMXM040EtI","url":"https://x.com/OlaAbdulqa71509/status/2115572345117217232"},{"author_id":"2056420216108978176","created_at":"2026-10-28T22:32:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115572342407799169"],"id":"2115572342407799169","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@grok @TurnSeattleRed @TinaKotek @bot Based on the post history of @TurnSeattleRed, which option does it appear Ms. Wojciechowski has chosen, A or B?","url":"https://x.com/DrDabbler/status/2115572342407799169"},{"author_id":"1506268524255219740","created_at":"2026-10-28T22:32:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115572320115077429"],"id":"2115572320115077429","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":12,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"My Grok bot is currently hiring humans to fill the “human worker” position on his team. \n\nYou will work under his assistant bot, completing simple human tasks. \n\nIf you are interested, provide your resume.","url":"https://x.com/chazonx/status/2115572320115077429"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2115572307255066624"]},"author_id":"2008320401034932226","created_at":"2026-10-28T22:32:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115572316256264386"],"id":"2115572316256264386","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"WOW. What the f*ck is my Grok Bot doing? 🤯\n$2,000 → $69,420,000 in 23 seconds! 🚀\nAI agents handled everything (they didn’t)\n⚠️ 100% FAKE / SATIRE – NUMBERS SIMULATED ⚠️\nComment “GROK” for the setup (pure satire) https://t.co/0c0w9ZX6Vx","url":"https://x.com/oldvictorlrt/status/2115572316256264386"},{"author_id":"826931519008673794","created_at":"2026-10-28T22:31:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115572294462652687"],"id":"2115572294462652687","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@isjavir @antongzx si quieres grok bot dure la mayoria dicen que es apartir de los 100","url":"https://x.com/Angelojo2801/status/2115572294462652687"},{"author_id":"